With these two fixes:

- hotSpot origins are correctly taken from the top-left corner per the KML spec, so your stars will truly center on their coordinates.
- All KML icons (including custom href icons) now get the standard DEFAULT_IMAGE_SCALE_MULTIPLIER when no explicit `<scale>` is given, matching Google Earth’s default sizing.
